open-ndi-monitor (0.1.5) stable; urgency=low

  * Fix video not displaying - support BGRA/BGRX format from NDI sources
  * Add bgra_to_bgr24 conversion for common NDI video formats
  * Detect actual FourCC format received and convert appropriately

  -- Micah Mount <dev@micahmount.com>  Thu, 09 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

open-ndi-monitor (0.1.4) stable; urgency=low

  * Exit gracefully when stream ends instead of freezing
  * Reconnect for 10 seconds before exiting (handles brief glitches)

  -- Micah Mount <dev@micahmount.com>  Thu, 09 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

