open-ndi-monitor (0.1.1) stable; urgency=low

  * Auto-detect HDMI audio device using aplay
  * Add audio_device config option
  * Add --audio-device and --list-audio-devices flags
  * Add SDL_AUDIODRIVER=alsa in systemd service
  * Change audio format from float to int16 for ALSA compatibility

 -- micah <micah>  Thu, 09 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000

open-ndi-monitor (0.1.0) stable; urgency=low

  * Initial release
  * Fullscreen NDI video monitoring via SDL2
  * Audio output with libsamplerate resampling to 48kHz
  * Automatic reconnection with exponential backoff
  * INI-style configuration
  * Systemd service file included

 -- micah <micah>  Tue, 07 Apr 2026 00:00:00 +0000